\" align=right>[ 김정식 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2009-01-24</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"5%\" align=right><IMG style=\"CURSOR: hand\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fboard_del.gif\"></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=1 background=/images/board_line.gif width=\"100%\" colSpan=4></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">축하드립니다. 몇일전 구입했는데요... ^^ 재과만에서 봤던 것들이 잘 정리된 느낌이었습니다. 잘 이용하겠습니다. 감사합니다.</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 김민우 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2009-01-26</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"5%\" align=right><IMG style=\"CURSOR: hand\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fboard_del.gif\"></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=1 background=/images/board_line.gif width=\"100%\" colSpan=4></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">책 출간...축하드려요. 늘 노력하시는 모습...정말 대단하신 것 같아요. 늘 감사합니다. </TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 권기순 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2009-02-02</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"5%\" align=right><IMG style=\"CURSOR: hand\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fboard_del.gif\"></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=1 background=/images/board_line.gif width=\"100%\" colSpan=4></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">항상 많은 것을 배우고 또 배워갑니다. 축하드립니다.^^ 빨리 구입해서 보고 싶네요..^^</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 서희주 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2009-02-09</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"5%\" align=right><IMG style=\"CURSOR: hand\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fboard_del.gif\"></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=1 background=/images/board_line.gif width=\"100%\" colSpan=4></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=25 width=\"70%\">우와 샘~~ 이제 알았어요~~ 정말 축하축하^^ </TD>\r\n<TD width=\"15%\" align=right>[ 최은정 ]</TD>\r\n<TD width=\"10%\" align=right>2010-03-10</TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></P>\n\t \t\t